<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 1.2 points to 884.6.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 1.2 points to 884.6.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 1.2 points on Wednesday to 884.6 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Four of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the food index rising the most, up five points to 1182.4.</p>
<p>Six indices fell, with the banking index losing the most, down 11.6 points to 1,284.8.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
